<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>io.github.alexwest1981.Sonix</id>
  <name>Sonix Studio</name>
  <summary>Native Linux digital audio workstation</summary>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>GPL-3.0-only</project_license>
  <description>
    <p>
      Sonix Studio is a native Linux DAW written in Rust: a channel rack with drums and
      synths, a piano roll, a multichannel effects mixer, a vocal studio with live
      recording, a modular patcher, VST3/CLAP plugin hosting and an AI assistant that can
      write a beat from a sentence.
    </p>
    <p>It runs on ALSA (PipeWire through its ALSA layer) and needs no daemon of its own.</p>
  </description>
